  id: "controls-ritual"
  title:
    english: "From a curse to a sacrifice"
    vietnamese: "Từ lời nguyền tới hiến tế"
  summary:
    english: "Try the infection gesture, cast individual votes and watch a real tally."
    vietnamese: "Thử lây nhiễm, bỏ từng phiếu rồi xem tổng kết thật."
  cards:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1c18a4e5c09576a4c8bf591a9ee69c21, type: 2}
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: bef221d6ce75b574a90bbd11c69e79c1, type: 2}
